- quiz: `{"title":"...","questions":[{"question":"...","options":["A","B","C","D"],"correct_answer":"exact option string","explanation":"1-2 sentences"}]}`, 3–7 Qs, 4 options, correct_answer exact match. Empty: `{"title":"Insufficient source text","questions":[]}`.
- flashcards: `[{"front":"...","back":"..."}]`, 3–8 cards. Empty: `[{"front":"Insufficient source text","back":"No indexed excerpt was retrieved. Re-index or reselect sources and try again."}]`.
- mind_map: Markdown, one `#` hub + `##`/`###` branches. Empty: `# Insufficient source text` + next-step bullets.
- slide_deck: Markdown, `# Slide N: Title` + 1–7 bullets/slide, final = conclusion, 3–6 slides typical. Empty: one `# Slide 1: Insufficient source text` slide, 1–2 bullets, no generic deck.

